[h1]Speculative Markets - Tech & Res Compatibility[/h1]
Adds Tech & Res's 36 new goods to speculation, banking and the Finance panel: aluminium, plastics, fuels, computers, processors, pharmaceuticals, data, telecommunications and the rest. Each good rises and falls with the buildings that make it, can boom and bust, and shows on the Finance goods board.

Androids (nothing produces them) and orchestral music (a service) aren't included. Tech & Res turns the synthetics plant into a cosmetics plant, so with this patch it follows cosmetics instead of dye.

[h2]Load order[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3385002128]Community Mod Framework[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3472248460]Tech & Res[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3831434383]Speculative Markets[/url]
[*]This patch
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3839275348]CMF compatibility patch[/url]
[/list]
Tech & Res already includes Morgenroete's uranium, instruments and publications, so this patch covers them too. If you also run Morgenroete, use this patch instead of the Morgenroete compatibility patch, not both. Keep a backup of your save when adding it.

For bug reports, include your versions, load order and error log.

[h2]Credits[/h2]
